    "defaultIcon": "view-dashboard-outline",
    "description": "Theme rail for the two-step layer filter (step 1). Configures its own theme list and owns the selection; pair it with a panel plugin (LayerFilter, or a swap-in) whose theme ids match. Events \u2014 emits: plugin:layerfilterthemes:selectedThemeChanged { themeId, initial? }.",
